  "description": "GEYKOO crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C59 H89 Ce4 N22 O3 Si2. From the CIF bond table, Ce2 (Ce) has 2 O neighbors; Ce1 (Ce) has 2 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 2 O neighbors; Ce4 (Ce) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.024-4.064 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.75-114.70°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C59H89Ce4N22O3Si2.",
